(text "U401 I2C address is 0x21 (A2:A1:A0 = 001); the existing keypad expander U4 remains at 0x20. Poll both card detect inputs." (at 16 91.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 564b098b-f775-55c6-b080-67b66b3b1c79))
(text "For the 3.4-inch ST7701S, bit-bang the 9-bit setup via P00/P01/P02. The 4-inch panel uses its module defaults. Pixel data uses RGB565." (at 16 96.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 8491ea7a-3802-51ca-9e01-64a59402b39b))
(text "The expander resets to inputs with weak pull-ups. Apply external safe-state pulls at the LCD and camera before enabling outputs." (at 16 101.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid f8ef7c55-cbc5-5968-aa26-99bbb5466bfa))
(text "Write output-latch safe levels first, then direction. U4 CAM_ENABLE controls DOVDD. U401 CAM_ANALOG_ENABLE controls the subsequent 2.8 V rail." (at 16 106.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid fca06edb-3c1d-5d36-a61d-b848bd58ce97))
(embedded_fonts no))
